      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HUMBLE TIGRESS (3) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing eighth (30.98) in a Grade 5 at Wentworth Park. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Has claims if she runs up to expectations. KOORINGA EXPRESS (4) goes very well this trip starting 12 times for five wins and five minors. Hit the frame latest (19.26) when second at this track in a NG. Can feature with the right run. MEAN PEACE (1) ran below her best last time finishing fifth (20.16) over 350m at Goulburn in a Grade 4/5. Solid record at the distance winning five races. The form from her last run stacks up well. Has ability and can atone. TAYLOR MADE BLUE (6) is worth consideration after filling a hole last start.",
